# ::tok Xinhua News Agency, Beijing, February 10th, newly entered members of the Central Committee, alternate members and major leading cadres at the provincial and ministerial levels to learn and implement Xi Jinping's new era of socialism with Chinese Characteristics and the Party's 20th National Congress Spirit seminar closed at the Central Party School (National Academy of Administration) on the afternoon of the 10th. Cai Qi, Member of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the Communist Party of China and Secretary of the Central Secretariat, attended the closing ceremony and made a concluding speech.
