# ::tok During the seminar, all the students took Xi Jinping's thought of socialism with Chinese characteristics in the new era as their guide, carefully studied the spirit of the 20th National Congress of the Party and the important speech of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the opening ceremony of the seminar, contacted actual in-depth discussions and exchanges, and deepened their understanding of a series of major theoretical and practical issues of Chinese-style modernization. Under the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, they have the confidence and determination to comprehensively promote the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation with Chinese-style modernization, and have enhanced their sense of responsibility and mission to perform their duties conscientiously, do a good job, and ensure a good start to the new era.
