# ::tok Liu Yiqian, head of the business of the Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center, told reporters from the Economic Observation Network that investors can learn about all their OTC public fund holdings through the “Fund E Account” App in one stop, helping them retrieve “forgotten assets”, and more importantly, for customers to achieve a comprehensive fund investment situation. The full account information is collected to help customers more timely, accurate and complete grasp of their own investment situation, so as to better optimize their own fund portfolio allocation and better plan their own financial arrangements.
