# ::tok The first time I bought something on Amazon, I felt a few points separately. Let's talk about the feeling of running out of goods first. The first is indeed painless and there is no irritating taste. Overall, it is very good. Wait for about 8 minutes and wipe it off. It's just that there will be a small amount of hair residue on it. If you don't take a closer look, you can't see it, so it's generally good. As for using it once after that, you have to continue to observe and you will only know if you continue to use it.
