# ::tok I think this collection of novels, and its title, is like a kind of performance art. What the author wants to express is that love is not just the joys and sorrows on the stage, the sea in urban legends is dry and rocky, and it is not just you and me. Love is not only the above and should not be represented by the above, love is also a dull life, boring day after day, there is also a loss of life, an escape from reality, and a loss of the future.
