# ::tok The order was placed during the Black Friday, but I waited for a long time and didn't receive it. When I inquired later, the package had already been signed for. I asked my colleagues around me and said that they didn't sign for it. I quickly contacted the courier company, but said that the sender could initiate the inquiry. I contacted Amazon customer service and waited for more than ten days. I finally figured out that the express delivery was mistakenly delivered to someone else, and after several turnover, the express delivery was finally retrieved. The outer packaging has been disassembled, and the goods are still complete. I don't know if they have been used. In short, it's very sad.
