# ::tok First of all, I just bought it for a few days and found that the price has been reduced. Bad reviews, this is pretty good, cost-effective, the cpu and graphics card are enough to cope with mainstream online games and a considerable number of large stand-alone machines. The heat dissipation is very good, but the screen is a bit light-leaking (a common problem with IPS screens), the audio quality is not very good, and the hard disk is not good (It is recommended to spend some money to add a solid state). Yesterday, I took it to the after-sales inspection and checked the hardware. There is no problem. The built-in win8.1 is not very useful. It is recommended to upgrade to 10. The seller shipped quickly, and the various inquiries were answered quickly. The invoice arrived the next day after receiving the computer. It's a pity. There are no gifts.
