# ::tok After buying it, there was no problem with the others, but when the software was connected, it couldn't be connected. My house is a TP router. After checking the Internet, I found that many people have this problem. It took more than two hours to get it. I changed the settings of the router. Finally, I used 360WIFI as the medium to fix it. During the period, I called Xiaomi customer service. They didn't have any solution to this problem, so they directly asked me to contact Amazon for after-sales.
